			<xsd:documentation>A data type for a representation of the METHOD of the
				characterization process, as follows: First Character: C: Automatic pattern
				classification without manual intervention N: Manually initiated or verified pattern
				classification Second Character: A: Minutiae automatically generated, no manual
				editing or verification E: Minutiae automatically generated, examiner verified or
				edited M: Minutiae manually generated by examiner Third Character: S: Automatic,
				synthesized ridge count without manual verification T: Automatic, actual ridge count
				without manual verification V: Automatic ridge count any method, examiner edited or
				verified </xsd:documentation>
		</xsd:annotation>
		<xsd:restriction base="xsd:string">
			<xsd:pattern value="[CN][AEM][STV]"/>
		</xsd:restriction>
	</xsd:simpleType>

